    {
     PaneBox[
      StyleBox["\<\"Figure 14. 12-period dynamic assignment (period length 5 \
min) on the toy Aberdeen network. Top-left: Gaussian-shaped demand profile \
peaking mid-morning. Top-right: path-flow evolution. Bottom-left: flow on \
four key links. Bottom-right: link-cost heatmap showing congestion spread and \
persistence.\"\>",
       StripOnInput->False,
