     PaneBox[
      StyleBox["\<\"Figure 15. Animated full-city simulation (600 vehicles, \
12 fps, 36 frames). Signal-controlled junctions impose the expected \
wave-structure on the arterial roads. The AWPR ring is clearly visible on the \
west/north perimeter and carries the lion's share of through-flow, exactly as \
intended when it opened in 2018. (MP4: \
Wolfram/results/aberdeen_full.mp4.)\"\>",
       StripOnInput->False,
